=== meta ===
rule: CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED
title: `allow_failure: true` on a lint job lets no test fail quietly
origin: issue #214 G7 — no global token: only a job whose `script:` invokes a test runner counts.
=== before: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== after: .gitlab-ci.yml ===
stages:
  - lint
  - test

lint:
  stage: lint
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install ruff
    - ruff check .
  allow_failure: true

test:
  stage: test
  image: python:3.12
  script:
    - pip install -e .[test]
    - pytest
=== expect ===
[{"rule": "CI_WORKFLOW_TOUCHED", "severity": "warn"}]
